==Trivia==
* The name zygomite comes from {{WP|Zygomycota}}, an outdated term for a phylum of the kingdom {{WP|Fungi}}. 
* The netting around the Ancient Fungi bears resemblance to the indusium ("skirt") of several species of mushroom of the genus ''{{WP|Phallus (fungus)|Phallus}}'', such as the {{WP|Phallus indusiatus|basket stinkhorn}} (''Phallus indusiatus'').
* A [[Update:Summer Sweep Up: Combat|2025 update]] and its companion [https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/2PACX-1vT5aIwPYJGCdUuO5rpNtYQE7FnERytSuj99zXkTBXf3XSIumSzjMQ9T1EXczWpMPZsRyZAcezWaQc6t/pubhtml spreadsheet] claimed that ancient zygomites would be receiving a drop of 2 [[grimy snapdragon]]s at a rate of 1/20, but instead a drop of 1 grimy snapdragon was added to the regular [[Zygomite#Level 86|level 86 zygomites]].
* The phrase "strong and stable" in the examine text is likely a reference to British Politician Theresa May's {{Wp|Strong and stable|oft-used slogan}}.

